Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Meta: official Facebook Login (OAuth) connection and a
 scheduled lead sync
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- lib/meta-oauth.ts: server-side code flow — signed, person-bound, 10-minute state (CSRF); one fixed https redirect URI;
  minimum documented scopes; code → long-lived token; permission check; error redaction; Arabic landing page
- POST /integrations/meta/oauth/start, GET /public/meta/oauth/callback, GET /integrations/meta/oauth/status
  (leads.config only, never a marketing company; the token is sealed at rest, never returned)
- POST /integrations/meta/sync/run + .github/workflows/meta-sync.yml: the linked campaigns' leads are pulled without
  anyone opening the app; one run at a time; idempotent with the webhook (leads.meta_lead_id)
- one Graph API version for all Meta calls (META_GRAPH_VERSION, default unchanged v21.0)
- Flutter: «اربط بحساب فيسبوك» and the connection status; pasting a token stays as «ربط بتوكن (متقدم)»
- docs/MARKETING_INTELLIGENCE_PROGRESS.md: the requirement checklist and the external setup still needed

No migration. Nothing applied to production.

