Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Meta sync: a final lead that crosses the deadline makes
 the pass incomplete
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- eachWithin: the budget is also checked after each item returns and once more at the end — a pass whose last lead ran
  past the deadline no longer reports success
- syncMeta: passComplete(complete, budget) right before the checkpoint; an overrun pass keeps its checkpoint; optional
  clock (default Date.now) for deterministic tests
- regression tests: the final lead starts inside the budget and ends past it (fake clock) → incomplete, checkpoint unchanged;
  normal completion still advances the checkpoint

No migration. Nothing applied to production.

